.mjx set Norm col=yel
IOS3270 online help quide. Refer to PDOM SB11-8419 for details.
.sti iospage ;first
.hv Off
IOS3270 <fn <ft <fm>>> <;sl1 <;el1 <;sl2 ...>>> <(options <)>>
.sh
Options:
.cjx set Norm col=tur, Ctl ¢ col=blu typ=hig) ali=att ali
¢Alarm    Sound audible alarm on first display.
¢Bind-n   Shift output n columns to the right.
¢FOr-n    Process n input records. Used with STEM option.
¢FRom-n   Start reading at input record n. Used with STEM option.
¢Hndext   Handle external interrupts (in-storage interface only).
¢HNDInt   Handle I/O interrupts (in-storage interface only).
¢Keepfile-(fn-<ft-<fm>><)>  Optional keep fileid.
¢Lib-ln   Use ln IOSLIB * as input; fn = member name.
¢LIFo     Stack input LIFO.
¢Noclear  Do not clear the screen on entry.
¢NOKeep   Do not insert keep.
¢NOQuit   Ignore quit in special fields.
¢NOWait   Do not wait for input, immediate exit after display.
¢Pa1------<EXIT|IGNORE> (&IOSK=PA1 if EXIT)
¢PA2------<EXIT|SUBSET> (&IOSK=PA2 if EXIT)
¢Query    screen. Sets &IOSD: www hhh <HIG> <COL> <PSS>
¢Stem-----symbol Get input from array symbol, ala EXECIO.
¢Time-n   Display max. n seconds. &IOSK=TIME if expired.
¢Update   Update an existing fullscreen.
¢Version  Returns 'IOS3270 Vv.w Rr.plc.loc mm/dd/yy' in &IOSD.
¢rrcc<c>  Cursor address; row, column.
¢00cc<c>  Cursor at cc'th input field.
.jx set Norm col=yel
.pi iospage ;middle
.hcjx set Norm col=tur
Return codes:
   ¢0  all fine; variables may have been set
   ¢1  specified input not found
   ¢2  no (graphic) console / disconnect
   ¢3  console i/o error
   ¢4  quit found in an input-, lightpen- of PFkey field.
   ¢5  insufficient storage for initialization
  ¢50  input stacked
 ¢142  the screen was in use by CP while trying to modify it
¢1xxx  xxx is return code from FSREAD reading input file
.phce¦
Function characters:
¢A   . . . . . . . . . . . . . .¦alarm
¢B   . . . . . . . . . . . . . .¦bottom title (intensified)
¢C   . . . . . . . . . . . . . .¦field definition characters in input
¢D *|fn <ft <fm>> <(recno>   . .¦define alternate fileid
¢Ex  . . . . . . . . . . . . . .¦define ending delimiter x
¢F<2> <func1 ... <funcn>>  . . .¦set PFkey functions 1-12 <13-24>
¢G   . . . . . . . . . . . . . .¦reserved.
¢H<n<n>>   . . . . . . . . . . .¦intensify next line(s)
¢I <IOS3270 parameters>  . . . .¦imbed
¢J< %$^#¢@!._|>  . . . . . . . .¦redefine field definition characters
¢JX Set  . . . . . . . . . . . .¦extended define; see next panel
¢K<(&keepid)>  . . . . . . . . .¦save input fields
¢L<->n<n>  . . . . . . . . . . .¦skip to line <->n<n>
¢M   . . . . . . . . . . . . . .¦maximum screen size to be used
¢N   . . . . . . . . . . . . . .¦do not edit input field data
¢O x   . . . . . . . . . . . . .¦define omission character x
¢P   . . . . . . . . . . . . . .¦page (screen) eject
¢Q   . . . . . . . . . . . . . .¦as .R, allow for input- lightpen fields
¢R   . . . . . . . . . . . . . .¦read stack or another file
¢S   . . . . . . . . . . . . . .¦space a line
¢T   . . . . . . . . . . . . . .¦end/reset top title(s)
¢U   . . . . . . . . . . . . . .¦reserved.
¢V Off | v1 d1 ... <vn dn> . . .¦set variables
¢W   . . . . . . . . . . . . . .¦force write to file (.d)
¢X   . . . . . . . . . . . . . .¦force stack
¢Y   . . . . . . . . . . . . . .¦pass input fields on PFkey usage
¢Z   . . . . . . . . . . . . . .¦clear bottom two lines' input fields
¢&vname. . . . . . . . . . . . .¦replace line by value of &vname
.pe h
 .jx syntax:
.s
 .jx Set Ctlchar c        OFF | optionA Type= Scope= Dynamic
         High-intensity   OFF | optionA ,
         Normal-intensity OFF | optionA ,
.jx set Ctl @ hil=bli, Ctl # hil=rev, Ctl $ hil=und
.jx set Mask
               $
         Mask <1|n> <Reuse>
.sc
optionA:
.scjx Set Norm Ali=Att com
¢Highlight= @Blink Default#Reverse $Underscore
.jx set Ctl @ col=gre, Ctl # col=pin, Ctl $ col=red, Ctl * col=tur
.cjx set Ctl \ col=blu, Ctl ¦ col=whi, Ctl " col=yel
 
¢Color=     \Blue Default@Green #Pink $Red *Turquoise ¦White "Yellow
¢PSid=      c<-comments> | nnn<-comments>
¢Align=     <(> Attributes Align | Off | Compress ,
                Variables  Align | Off | Float   <)>
¢Etmode=    <(> Default | No | Yes <)>
 
¢Type=      <(> Detectable Escape High-intensity Invisible
                Nulls NUMeric Skip Tab Unprotected <)>
 
¢Scope=     <(> Character <)>
 
 
.jx Set Norm Ali=Att off
.pch
IOSDYNAT EXEC calling format:
 Interpret iosdynat(Arg1; <Arg2>; <Arg3>; <Arg4 <... ;Argn>>)
 
¢Arg1 defines the affected field(s).
      Format: Ctl<,name>
 
¢Arg2 defines a dynamic field attribute or a function.
      Format: Ctla | 'RESET' | 'DROP'
 
¢Arg3 defines the cursor position within the field.
      Format: n
 
¢Arg4-n define character attributes.
      Format: Parm1 <... <;Parmn>>
      ¢Parmx: Ctlc <,start <,length>>
.ph
Initial field definition characters:
.scjx set Ctl " off
¢.j-%$^#¢@!.              " " = leave as-is, "&" = reset.
    |||||||||'-input, autoskip.
    ||||||||'-'fill' character for input fields.
    |||||||'-variable place holder.
    ||||||'-pen select, intensify.
    |||||'-pen select.
    ||||'-input, non display.
    |||'-input, intensify, autoskip.
    ||'-input, intensify.
    |'-input.
    '-intensify.
.pe h
Variables set on return to caller:
.sc
¢&IOSK - ENTER; PEN; PFnn; PA1; PA2; TIME
¢&IOSC - cursor position: rrccc
¢&IOSD - PFkey/lightpen value; blanks
.sh
Specials:
.sc
 Value | Field type     | Function
-------+----------------+------------------------------------
¢QUIT  | any            | Immediate exit RC=4
¢BACK  | PFkey/lightpen | Back 1 page
.c ¢COPY  | PFkey/lightpen | Copy screen to IOS3270 SCREENS
¢<     | PFkey/lightpen | Null input (simulate ENTER; no data)
¢>     | PFkey/lightpen | Exit (pass characters after '>'
.jx set Norm col=yel
.i iospage ;last
